M03 follow-up: primary objective 1010 (Escape) is added when M03CON010 ends
(310,3). Its only completer, 310,1, is in M03_Outro_Cinematic, which is not
bound in m03.ldd, m03.lsd or objects.ddb and is never attached. The mission
therefore ends through exit zone 2000817 with Escape still pending.

Complete it from the exit zone instead. M03_Mission_Complete_Zone sends
310,1 to the objective controller (1100004) inside its existing
already_entered guard (saved), immediately before Mission_Complete(true).
Delivery has no delay, so it is synchronous, and the objective is
accomplished before the mission ends. If 1010 was never added, the
controller's Set_Objective_Status reaches the original "objective not
found" no-op. Mission completion itself is unchanged.

--- a/Mission03.cpp
+++ b/Mission03.cpp
@@ -6059,6 +6059,11 @@
 		{
 			already_entered = true;
 			
+			// Vita port: Escape (1010) has no live completer; its 310,1 sender
+			// M03_Outro_Cinematic is not bound. Complete it here, once, before the
+			// mission ends (synchronous; a no-op if 1010 was never added).
+			Commands->Send_Custom_Event(obj, Commands->Find_Object(1100004), 310, 1, 0);
+
 			Commands->Mission_Complete ( true );
 		}
 	}
